<tei:p><tei:pb n="790" ed="1949 concluding_prayers" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n814_medium.jpg"/><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tefillah_lishlom_medinat_yisrael/4"/>Unite our heart to love and revere thy name, and to observe all the precepts of thy Torah. Shine forth in thy glorious majesty over all the inhabitants of thy world. Let everything that breathes proclaim: “The Lord God of Israel is King; his majesty rules over all.” Amen.<tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
